	"data": "Decision: Model Strategy\n\nContext\nHeavy daily usage of AI models was accumulating per-token costs. Needed a sustainable model strategy across different task types.\n\nDecision\nMain driver: github-copilot/claude-sonnet-4.6 — flat rate via GitHub Copilot subscription, best value for heavy usage\nRAG/summarization: kimi-k2.5:cloud via Ollama Cloud (free tier)\nLocal/offline: llama3.2:latest via Ollama on star\nAvoid: GPT-5.4 and GPT-5.4-pro (expensive per-token)\n\nRationale\nGitHub Copilot flat-rate…",
